  "content_en": "Chapter 1 When the first married prince opened his eyes, the surroundings were already bright and clear. How long have you slept? Luo Xue turned her head outwards, and the sleeping figure of Xunyang with one hand on her cheek by the bed came into her sight. A small touch melted into her heart. He loves me, right? But I can't give him the same love. For a woman who doesn't belong to the Luo clan, the person she falls in love with must be the person who makes her feel safe, and... \"Luo Xue, are you awake?\" It was probably Luo Xue who woke him up when she moved. Prince Yu put down his hand and asked with concern. \"How long have I slept?\" \"One night.\" \"Last night, that... head...\" Thinking of the head last night, Luo Xue was a little scared. \"It belongs to the assassin.\" \"He was injured...\" \"I guess he might have slipped into the palace at night and was discovered by a guard. After a fight, the guard died, and he was injured and hid in the small building.\" Prince Yu stood up and put his hands behind his back, \"I have already punished the guard.\" \"Punishment?\" Luo Xue frowned, \"Why?\" \"They did something bad, and they still ask you to suffer. She was shocked.\" Luo Xue felt guilty after hearing that she was being punished. \"It was my fault, I shouldn't have been so curious.\" Prince Yu ignored Luo Xue's explanation and continued, \"As for Xi Yi, it's up to you to do what she wants to do.\" \"Kneel outside? I want to go out and take a look.\" \"Lie down!\" Prince Yu said to her in a commanding tone. \"But, Xiyi is still outside. Xiyi is not wrong. Without her, you won't be able to see me.\" Seeing that her persuasion was fruitless, Luo Xue did not lie down obediently. She shouted outside: \"Xiyi, get up. You are not wrong!\" Kneeling outside, Xiyi heard Luo Xue's voice and wanted to move but did not dare to move. She replied: \"Madam, Yiyi is here. Madam, it was Xiyi who made the mistake first, and he deserves to be punished!\" Oops! Why is this girl so stubborn? Is it only his words that will do? Luo Xue looked at Xunyang, only to see him looking outside with his hands behind his hands. He got up, walked to Xunyang and said, \"I'm hungry.\" \"Then ask the kitchen to make some side dishes for you. Someone...\" \"Wait a minute, I want to eat the dish from last night.\" \"What dish, ask the cook to make it.\" \"I don't know, what's the dish in the palace?\" There are so many, it seems that Xi Yi brought them to me yesterday. \"Oh, is that so?\" Prince Yu looked at Xi Yi, \"What kind of food did you give to Madam yesterday?\" Xi Yi was as confused as Monk Zhang Er. Yesterday, I kept waiting outside my wife's door. It was obviously Xiaoxi's gift. \"Ouch~ You are so cruel, why don't you scare her? Asking for the name of a dish is like interrogating a prisoner. Will I starve to death when I find out?\" Luo Xue said as she put her hand on her stomach, pretending to be so hungry that she couldn't bear it. \"Why don't you ask her to go to the kitchen and bring it to me now. Xiyi, go and serve me the food. It's the same dish as yesterday. If it's not available, just have some snacks or something.\" Xiyi was still kneeling on the ground. She knew what Luo Xue meant, but she couldn't get up because the prince hadn't spoken yet. \"What are you looking at? Go quickly!\" Prince Yu looked at Xi Yi and finally spoke. Seeing that the prince agreed, Xi Yi stood up, nodded and said yes, endured the soreness of his legs, and stepped back. \"Haha\" Luo Xue smiled as she watched Xi Yi walk away. Prince Yu sat down, picked up the tea cup on the table, took a sip, and said, \"Are you satisfied?\" \"So you know.\" After saying that, Luo Xue also sat down, poured herself a glass of water, drank it, and asked as if she remembered something: \" What did the assassin do yesterday?\" \"I don't know.\" Prince Yu said calmly, \"That's how the palace is, there are always some mysterious people appearing.\" \"Is he hiding something? Could it be that his hurried departure had something to do with this incident? \"What are you thinking about?\" Prince Yu knocked on the table, \"I really don't understand why you always like to be in a daze!\" \"In a daze? Me? When have you ever seen me in a daze? It was just once today!\" Luo Xue defended herself. \"I've known you for more than a day or two. Every time I see you in the plum garden, I sigh instead of being in a daze.\" Prince Yu held Luo Xue's hand, \"Is there anything unhappy about you?\" \"No!\" He squeezed out an extremely exaggerated smile. Remembering that she hadn't seen Xiao Xi for a while, she asked, \"Where is Xiao happy?\" \"Xiao happy has gone back. She was tired after watching you all night.\"\"Oh.\" Didn't you also stay overnight? Luo Xue didn't say it out loud, but she was still grateful to him in her heart. \"Your Majesty, Madam.\" Xiyi stood outside the door holding a vegetable box. Seeing Xi Yi coming, Luo Xue hurriedly called him in, \"Okay, the food is here, but I'm starving to death.\" \"Bring the food here.\" Prince Yu ordered. After a while, several side dishes were lying on the table obediently, waiting for the tragedy that was about to enter the human stomach. \"Come, try this. I found that the food in the palace is really delicious.\" Luo Xue took the chopsticks, picked up what she thought was delicious, and put it into the bowl in front of Prince Yu. Prince Yu looked at Luoxue, who was eating delicious food in front of him, and said with a smile: \"Such a dish, I'm afraid only you will find it delicious?\" \"Who said that? I'm afraid you are in the midst of blessings and don't know the blessings!\" \"Is it blessing? I just hope to be an ordinary person.\" If you were an ordinary person, would I give my heart to you? I can't have love for you, so why don't you ask me to make it up to you? Luo Xue put down her chopsticks, \"Okay, I'm full. I'm a little stuffed. Are you busy?\" \"Are you busy?\" \"Come with me to the kitchen. I'll teach the cook how to cook a few dishes for the common people, so you know how hard the common people's lives are.\" Although she is a young lady from Meiyuan, she still knows how hard the common people's lives are. \"You want to cook for me?\" Prince Yu's eyes widened. Luo Xue lowered her head and shook her head, \"I don't know how, but I can teach them how to do it.\" Hesitantly, Prince Yu looked at the woman in front of him and thought: Although Meiyuan is not an official family, it's not like he would ask a lady to enter the kitchen, right? \"What are you thinking! You said that I was in a daze, but you were in a daze. Take me to the kitchen.\" \"What did you just say? Did you say that I was in a daze?\" \"You heard wrong, take me quickly, let's go, let's go!\" I was secretly glad that I was safe, but why did he hear me? Luo Xue didn't believe it. ...This was the first time that Prince Yu took Luo Xue to visit the palace. He believed that Luo Xue really wanted to know the location of the kitchen, so he asked Luo Xue to remember it every step of the way. And Luo Xue also remembered it seriously, thinking to herself, how embarrassing it would be if she really got lost in the palace! In case she lost it one day, the palace mobilized all the people to search for it for a long time, and it turned out that the lady went to the kitchen and got lost... Thinking of this, Luo Xue couldn't help laughing. Prince Yu knocked Luo Xue on the head with his hand, \"What are you thinking about? Have you written down everything I just told you?\" \"I have written it down. Where is this place?\" \"Really written it down? Did you hear the last sentence I said?\" \"Yes!\" \"If you heard it, you wouldn't know where this is?!\" Prince Yu raised his eyebrows, \"This is the kitchen!\" \"Oh, here we are, let's go in.\" He picked up the prince and went inside. As soon as he entered, he saw the people in the kitchen, whether they were cooks or servants, all stopped their movements 