help but speed up her pace. \"Sister, why are you here?\" The voice sounded like Princess Ting Ning. Luo Xue turned around and bowed: \"Luo Xue, please say hello to my sister.\" Princess Ting Ning helped Luo Xue up, \"We are all sisters, so don't be so particular.\" When she said this, there was no sign of competing for favor at the dinner table. She paused and said, \"Sister, are you bored too?\" \"That's right. I wanted to take a walk, but I happened to meet my sister.\" \"Why don't you come with me for a walk?\" the princess said. Even if she was unwilling, she couldn't refuse, so Luo Xue could only nod. After walking for a short while, Ting Ning spoke first: \"Sister, are you trying to compete with you for favor?\" \"Sister, what are you talking about? Luo Xue just got married, how can you mean this? Sister is worrying too much.\" Luo Xue was secretly surprised. The princess was still the princess after all. What did she want to express? When you open your mouth like this, aren't you blaming yourself? Ting Ning gently caressed her unpregnant belly, \"Actually, I also know that I can't compare with you. In my heart, you are the most important, but now that I am pregnant with your child, I just want to think about the child. After marrying into the prince's palace, my father is our God. Whatever he tells us, we must obey, because we are all his women.\" Somehow, Luo Xue thought of the inkstone, but when she thought about it, it was indeed the case. Even if it was in name only, what could it mean? The water thrown out by a married daughter cannot come back. \"Even if I don't love you, we must learn to love you and regard what you have given us as a gift from God.\" \"A gift from God?\" Luo Xue secretly sighed at the thought of the woman in front of her. Is such a woman likely to love the prince more than herself? Princess Ting Ning took Luo Xue's hand and said mockingly: \"Well, based on this, my sister is much richer than me.\" Luo Xue put her other hand up: \"Sister, Luo Xue understands what you mean, but Luo Xue has no intention of competing with you for the position of princess, please rest assured, sister.\" \"Sister, you are worrying too much.\" Although she said this, she couldn't hide the smile with the word \"reassured\" on her face. \"In the future, we have to move around frequently. The courtyard is deep and it is good to take care of each other.\" \"Well, Luo Xue will accompany her sister when she has time.\" After a few simple greetings, Luo Xue left with an excuse. Facing such a woman, she felt tired. When I returned to the small building in the center of the lake, I saw Xiao Xi coming over, \"Miss, you are back. I was worried to death. Xiao Xi just took a nap in the house, and when I woke up, the lady was gone.\" She looked aggrieved. He pinched Xiao Xi's cheek with his hand and said with a smile, \"Are you afraid that Xiao Xi overslept?\" \"Miss, no! It's not like that.\" \"I'm kidding you!\" \"Madam!\" The speaker was Xi Yi. When she saw Luo Xue coming, she knelt down on the ground without hesitation. \"Xi Yi, what's wrong with you?\" Luo Xue didn't know what happened. \"Xi Yi, thank you, madam.\" Xi Yi expressed his thoughts in a few simple words. \"Don't thank me, get up. Xiyi, I have to ask you to go to the kitchen tonight and help me bring the dishes I asked the cook to cook.\" \"Yes, madam!\" \"Miss, what dish is it?\" Xiaoxi asked curiously. There was no way, she was just too curious. Luo Xue covered her mouth with a silk handkerchief and smiled: \"It's a secret. The prince will tell you to come over tonight, and we'll just wait.\"... In the evening, Prince Yu came to Xiaozhu as promised, stepped in the door, and said eagerly: \"I'm here to check my wife's results.\" Luo Xue He handed the prince a cup of tea and said with a smile: \"These are simple meals, which are the most common dishes among the common people.\" He took the cup of tea, but did not drink it in a hurry. He put it down and picked up the chopsticks. \"Then I will be considerate of the people.\" After saying that, he started to taste it. \"What is this?\" \"Cooked cabbage stewed with tofu, is it delicious?\" \"Yeah!\" He said and picked up other vegetables, without asking any questions, and just tasted them. Looking at Prince Yu in front of her, Luo Xue thought: Such a prince really doesn't know the sufferings of people's livelihood! In the eyes of the common people, they always think that a prince should have a high bed, a warm pillow, fine clothes and fine food, and be surrounded by beauties. But who would have thought that the Luo Xue he loves now can't love him, and the concubines who love him are miserable alone... \"Xi Yi, go to the kitchen to get the last dish!\" \"Yes!\" \"The last dish? What is it?\" Prince Yu put down his chopsticks. Luo Xue spread her hands and said mysteriously: \"It can't be said!\" After a moment,After waiting, Xiyi walked in carrying the food box, bringing with it a stench. Prince Yu felt strange, made adjustments, and immediately felt calm again. Luo Xue caught the slight change in his expression, thinking that the good show was yet to come, and then opened the food box, and suddenly the room was filled with a confusing stench. Prince Yu couldn't bear it any longer. He covered his nose and said, \"What is this? It can't be broken, right?\" Luo Xue shook her head, picked up the bowl and chopsticks, picked out a small piece, and brought it to Prince Yu's mouth: \"How could it be broken? This is a common thing in ordinary people's homes!\" Prince Yu dodged and asked, \"What on earth is it?\" \"Stinky tofu!\" Luo Xue held up the bowl and chopsticks and approached him. \"Take a bite!\" \"I don't want it! Take it away!\" \"Take a bite! Take a bite!\"... The night that should have been silent will no longer be quiet.",
